  "definition": "Electricians' Board (Rules were renumbered Saf-C for the Department of Safety pursuant to transfer of the Board to the Department of Safety, effective 7-1-05. See RSA 21-P:12, VI, RSA 319-C:4, IV, and RSA 21-G:9, II(b). The rules have been numbered Elec again pursuant to transfer of the Board from the Department of Safety and establishment of the Board's rulemaking authority under RSA 319-C:6-a. See 2012, 237:1-3, 5, and 7 and 2013, 57:4, effective 6-4-13.)",
